===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|pejorative}} An intellectually pretentious person; a [[pseudointellectual]].
# A [[poseur]]; one who is [[fake]].
# {{lb|en|travel industry|informal}} [[pseudo-city code]]
# {{lb|en|Internet|clipping}} A [[pseudonym]]; a false name used for online anonymity.
